            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LocaRec 0.8.0


### Added

- Closing your Mac's lid during a recording stops and saves it, the same as pressing Stop. This also works when an external display keeps the Mac awake with the lid shut. If you start a recording with the lid already closed, LocaRec leaves it running. Putting the Mac to sleep from the Apple menu stops a recording too.

Build: 53
Commit: 0a0861a
